{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i", "title": "公孫丑上", "description": "公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "役", "id": "役"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "惻", "id": "惻"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "端", "id": "端"}, {"form": "羞", "id": "羞"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "辭", "id": "辭"}, {"form": "體", "id": "體"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.2308802572458604, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.4576903690123786, "source": "政", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.9240274378058058, "source": "政", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.0022148403295528213, "source": "政", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.7569733531426395, "source": "禮", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.063826172582694, "source": "禮", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.5301632413761213, "source": "禮", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 2.24248116892434, "source": "禮", "target": "辭"}, {"weight": 0.6083506438998684, "source": "禮", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.8370160608161759, "source": "禮", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.628775530044231, "source": "禮", "target": "役"}, {"weight": 2.7124847981700757, "source": "禮", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.3760125615488628, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.7514514875405416, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.1624384612508036, "source": "心", "target": "惻"}, {"weight": 1.7569733531426395, "source": "心", "target": "羞"}, {"weight": 0.7761441001309132, "source": "心", "target": "辭"}, {"weight": 1.7569733531426395, "source": "心", "target": "端"}, {"weight": 0.21652831219549054, "source